  "raw_text": "PLAN \"Week 5 Deload\"\nTYPE workout\nVISIBILITY public\n\nGOALS\n  GOAL primary hypertrophy:\n    name \"Recover and maintain muscle between hypertrophy blocks\"\n\nPHASES\n  PHASE \"Deload\" (1 week):\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Monday training 45m \"Upper Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 5m\n        main straight_sets:\n          bench_press 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          barbell_row 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          shoulder_press 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 75 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 75 seconds\n          bicep_curl 2x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          tricep_pushdown 2x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          shoulder_stretch 3m\n          chest_stretch 3m\n      DAY Tuesday training 45m \"Lower Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 5m\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 2x6..8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          romanian_deadlift 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_press 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          calf_raise 2x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          plank 2x30 rpe 5 rest 45 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 3m\n          hamstring_stretch 3m\n      DAY Thursday training 40m \"Upper Deload B\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 5m\n        main straight_sets:\n          incline_press 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          cable_row 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 75 seconds\n          lateral_raise 2x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          cable_pulldown 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 75 seconds\n          hammer_curl 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          skull_crusher 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          lat_stretch 3m\n          tricep_stretch 3m\n      DAY Friday training 40m \"Lower Deload B\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 5m\n        main straight_sets:\n          romanian_deadlift 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          hack_squat 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_extension 2x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          hip_thrust 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 75 seconds\n          seated_calf_raise 2x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          dead_bug 2x10 rpe 5 rest 45 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hip_flexor_stretch 3m\n          butterfly_stretch 3m",
